    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100">

                <pb facs="0278" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg272"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merrill to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 249.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States.</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-07-09"><hi rendition="#italic">July 9,
                        1889</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that the
                    anniversary of the Independence of the United States was celebrated here with
                    much enthusiasm, and the 4th instant was observed as a general holiday by both
                    native and foreign residents.</p>
                <p>The Government offices and the business houses in the city were generally
                    closed.</p>
                <p>A reception was held at the legation and was largely attended by all
                    nationalities.</p>
                <p>I inclose clippings from each of the daily papers, Advertiser and Bulletin,
                    giving accounts of the proceedings of the day.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ed. W. Merrill.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d100-a1.xml" xpointer="d100-a1"/>
